  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By virtue of its scale and siting, the proposed two-storey rear extension would lead to a loss of outlook from a first-floor habitable room of no. 52 Vansittart Road by interrupting the 45-degree angle of outlook when measured from the centre of the window. This would cause harm to the amenity of the occupier of the bedroom and is to the detriment of continued enjoyment of the dwelling. The proposal therefore fails to comply with the amenity protection objectives of Policy 57 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
